    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under a blood-red moon, every shadow wants you dead. Carve through swarming horrors in a fast\u2011paced, top\u2011down arena where the glow of torches is your only refuge. Chain sword slashes with dashes, targeted teleports, and an expanding spell arsenal, scorch mobs with a conjured flamethrower, shatter lines with chain lightning, fling a ricocheting shield, or harpoon enemies with grappling hooks. Gather arcane symbols, brew potent potions, and when the tide turns, embrace the curse and unleash your inner werewolf.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light vs. Dark Survival</strong> \u2013 Health and mana regenerate only inside healing light, forcing risky excursions into the shadows for rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spell-Powered Combat</strong> \u2013 Teleport across the arena, incinerate foes with flamethrowers, call down chain lightning, yank enemies with grappling hooks, or hurl bouncing shields</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shapeshift &amp; Upgrades</strong> \u2013 Transform into a speed\u2011fueled werewolf, collect arcane symbols, quaff potions, and shop for gear to forge your build</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escalating Waves &amp; Bosses</strong> \u2013 Endure relentless waves and clash with monstrous bosses, each with unique tactics and arenas</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under a blood-red moon, every shadow wants you dead. Carve through swarming horrors in a fast\u2011paced, top\u2011down arena where the glow of torches is your only refuge. Chain sword slashes with dashes, targeted teleports, and an expanding spell arsenal, scorch mobs with a conjured flamethrower, shatter lines with chain lightning, fling a ricocheting shield, or harpoon enemies with grappling hooks. Gather arcane symbols, brew potent potions, and when the tide turns, embrace the curse and unleash your inner werewolf.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light vs. Dark Survival</strong> \u2013 Health and mana regenerate only inside healing light, forcing risky excursions into the shadows for rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spell-Powered Combat</strong> \u2013 Teleport across the arena, incinerate foes with flamethrowers, call down chain lightning, yank enemies with grappling hooks, or hurl bouncing shields</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shapeshift &amp; Upgrades</strong> \u2013 Transform into a speed\u2011fueled werewolf, collect arcane symbols, quaff potions, and shop for gear to forge your build</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escalating Waves &amp; Bosses</strong> \u2013 Endure relentless waves and clash with monstrous bosses, each with unique tactics and arenas</p></li></ul>",
